  text: "The legend is true. \r\nAll of it. \r\n<link>Big Foot</link> is a (REDA)
    like (REDACTED) humanoid creature that roams the Earth barefoot since (REDA).
    It is probably one of the better known (REDA) (RE) (REDACTED) of all time. It
    is easily recognizable by its tall, muscular and ape-like figure, and being almost
    completely covered with strong brown reddish weird hair.\r\n\r\nThere've been
    alleged sightings of the thing all over the globe, many appearing to contradict
    each other in its nature and p-_ \n----------------------------------------------
    \n               /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n\r----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\n \r\nIts inadvertent presence in one too many history pivotal moments
    have made i_- \n---------------------------------------------- \n              
    /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n\r----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\n \r\nThanks to a distant cousin and two opera records, the 1945 treaty
    of (RE) was signed by all (REDACTED) parties, ending decades of mutual prejudice.
    Free reign was given to the thing in exchange of discreti- \n----------------------------------------------
    \n               /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n\r----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n \r\n\r\nTo the surprise of the uneducated man the thing has kept up to date
    with modern technology, and tends to communicate better by email than speaking.
    This has led to many a  \n---------------------------------------------- \n              
    /<i>CONTEXTUAL EDIT</i>/\r\n\r----------------------------------------------    
    \r\n  \r\nIt Is considered an endangered (REDACTED) species, the last of its
    kind, and its survival be prioritized over the common (REDACTED) and human. \r\n\r
    \r\n<i><b>BEHAVIORAL PROFILE:</b></i> Though calm and esoteric, the thing is
    not a stranger to violence. Confrontation should be avoided and compliance adopted
    against all odds (except of course if it would mean going against the (REDA)s
    will or (REDACTED) standard protocol). \r\n "
